<title>HUNGARY: DUNAHOLDING REDUCES GROUP LOSSES IN Q1.</title>
<headline>DUNAHOLDING REDUCES GROUP LOSSES IN Q1.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month period ending March</p>
<p>31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				    Jan-March 1997   Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating result     29.6 loss  vs    205.0 loss</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax result	 75.6 loss  vs    201.5</p>
<p>    Group after-tax result     75.6 loss  vs    205.6</p>
<p>    Group net sales	   1,512.5	 vs  1,591.0</p>
<p>    Other revenue		  11.7	 vs     85.4</p>
<p>    Material expenditures   1,259.1	 vs  1,181.4</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures    241.3	 vs    243.8</p>
<p>    Other costs		   116.4	 vs    150.8</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	   31.5	 vs     94.6</p>
<p>    Net financial income	 37.9 loss  vs	2.4 profit</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income    8.1 loss  vs	1.1 profit</p>
<p>    Taxation			  0	   vs	4.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Dunaholding Rt is a financial consulting company.</p>
<p>The figures are consolidated, unaudited and were calculated in</p>
<p>accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom+36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
